2659	Lawn Aerator Tool for Clay Soil - Kick to Unclog & Bolt-On Base Never Breaks - 11 Heavy-Duty 3.5” Spikes for Deeper Penetration - Pre-Assembled 12.2x6” Plate	AHXPOCF	45.99	["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oIxZ89r5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wHBCXqZyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HhnYfTDNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616fCExYEPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511iO93feHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F3ZL3nISL._AC_SL1500_.jpg", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51t8JLq1zVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"]	{"bsr": 48432, "specs": {"Item Weight": "8.6 pounds", "Product Dimensions": "16.34 x 10.24 x 6.1 inches"}, "rating": 4.3, "bullets": ["1. KICK-TO-UNCLOG & EASY-CLEAR DESIGN: This lawn aerator features a patented crescent pedal that lets you clear clogged springs in seconds with a simple stomp. This foot-powered clearing system prevents mud build-up in wet clay, eliminating the need to stop and pry by hand. It ensures continuous, efficient aeration, making it the ultimate manual lawn aerator for tackling damp or compacted soil conditions.", "2. REPAIRABLE BOLT-ON BASE - LASTING VALUE: Why discard the entire tool? Unlike common welded aerators that break irreparably, our unique bolt-on base allows you to replace any damaged part in about a minute with the included toolkit. This design extends the tool's lifespan indefinitely, offering lasting value and reducing waste. It’s a lawn aerator tool built for durability and easy maintenance.", "3. DEEPER PENETRATION WITH 11 HEAVY-DUTY SPIKES: Engineered for challenging soil, this aerator for compacted soil is equipped with 11 robust, 3.5-inch (8.9 cm) M8 steel spikes. These fewer but longer, thicker spikes are designed to drive deeper into hard clay and sloped terrain than standard models, ensuring water and nutrients reach grass roots more effectively for a healthier lawn.", "4. REINFORCED & RUST-RESISTANT CONSTRUCTION: Built with a reinforced 2mm steel frame that resists bending, this grass aerator features a matte anti-rust finish, making it suitable for use in damp conditions. It comes pre-assembled and includes a free hardware kit (extra M8 bolts and wrenches) for long-term support. Non-slip treads and a safety guard ensure secure operation on various terrains.", "5. PRO TIPS FOR OPTIMAL AERATION RESULTS: For best performance with this heavy-duty lawn aerator: On hard, dry soil, water lightly 24 hours prior to soften the ground for deep, easy penetration. On wet, sticky clay, allow the surface to dry briefly for smooth, non-clog operation. This simple preparation ensures the 11 deep-penetrating spikes deliver professional-grade aeration results every time."], "isPrime": true, "reviews": 48, "category": "Deliver to\\n                \\n                \\n                   New York 10001‌", "currency": "USD", "description": "Product description   \\n                     \\n    .aplus-v2 .aplus-content-wrapper {\\n        position: relative;\\n        overflow: hidden;\\n    }\\n\\n    .aplus-v2 .container-with-background-image {\\n        width: 100%;\\n        height: 100%;\\n        background-repeat: no-repeat;\\n        background-size: cover;\\n    }\\n\\n  \\n    function logShoppableMetrics(moduleName, showsAddToCart) {\\n        if (window.ue && window.ue.count) {\\n            window.ue.count(\\"aplus:shoppable:\\" + moduleName + \\":addToCart\\", showsAddToCart ? 1 : 0);\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n\\n                             \\n        \\n\\n.aplus-v2 .premium-aplus-module-2 .premium-background-wrapper {\\n    position: relative;\\n}\\n\\n.aplus-v2 .premium-aplus-module-2 .premium-intro-wrapper {\\n    position: absolute;\\n    width: 50%;\\n    height: 100%;\\n    top: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.aplus-v2 .premium-aplus-module-2 .premium-intro-wrapper.right {\\n    left: 50%;\\n}\\n\\nhtml[dir=\\"rtl\\"] .aplus-v2 .premium-aplus-module-2 .premium-in